    "OT_VERSE_LINE": "Genesis 11:7 — “Come, let us go down and there confuse their language, so that they will not understand one another's speech.”",
    "NT_VERSE_LINE": "Acts 2:6 — “The multitude came together, and were confounded, because that every man heard them speak in his own language.”",
